[ceiling] Functional tie tunnel: under each Reservoir A paired seat the strap runs through a 3.2 mm transverse slot. This 7.5 × 3.2 mm roof is the seat's ridge between the two tubes, 1.6 mm over the slot floor, and it bridges the slot's 3.2 mm width.
alternatives: An open-topped slot cuts the ridge that carries both tubes' grooves. A sloped roof takes stock from that ridge or deepens the slot into the lid's floor stock.
file: hardware/printed-parts/cold-core/foam-cap/foam-cap-lid-top.step
